ew3T1710863944349\":[],\"7hprxjqdcoyT1747277464255\":[],\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":[\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\",\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\",\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\",\"7hprxjqdcoyT1747277464255\"],\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":[],\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":[]},\"contents\":{\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":{\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【关于璃月港。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e哦～你对我的家乡感兴趣啊。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e璃月有着全提瓦特最繁华的商港，在那里汇集着各个国家的商人，我也是从小耳濡目染才选择经商的，嘿嘿。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e听说过摩拉克斯大人吗，那位守护着璃月的神明？\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e那你至少应该知道，你手里的摩拉就是以他的名字命名的！\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e唉，好久没回去了，莫非我就是离摩拉克斯大人太远了，所以才赚不到钱？\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"},\"7hprxjqdcoyT1747277464255\":{\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【再见。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e果然你也不买吗！\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"},\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":{\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【开场白】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e还真是完全卖不出去呢…\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"},\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":{\"icon\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/05/15/50494840/11ee64c710e3b091256c0d349ac55461_2792857816270901822.png\",\"option\":\"【你在这里卖什么？】——打开商店界面\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e请您随便选！都是从璃月来的上好货色，实惠又好看！\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"},\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":{\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【什么卖不出去？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e珠宝啊，这些可都是我从璃月港带来的，百年老字号「明星斋」的货品，瞧瞧这成色!\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e…看你的打扮，是旅行者吗？好吧，你想说这些对旅行没用的东西，买来也没必要是吧？\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e唉…我还真是失算了，本以为来到蒙德可以拓展销路…\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e可没想到这里的人，宁愿把口袋里的钱全都拿去买酒也不愿看上一眼…\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e莫非其实是买不起？唔…确实不是所有的城市都像璃月那么富足…\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"}}}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"3885","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1747621708","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"69","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"691","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1207","pos":"left"},{"id":"1208","pos":"right"},{"id":"3882","pos":"banner"}],"name":"基本资料","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"692","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"1209","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":true,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"693","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"1210","pos":"banner"},{"id":"3885","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"694","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1211","pos":"left"},{"id":"1212","pos":"right"}],"name":"","repeated":true,"parent_group_id":"0"}]}]},"edit_lock_status":"Unlock","correct_lock_status":"Unlock","menus":[{"id":"20","name":"NPC\u0026商店","has_page":false,"style":"","sub_menus":[],"icon":"","mi18n_key":"NPC\u0026商店","is_hidden":false,"parent_id":"189","template_id":"","bg_img":"","ch_ext":"[{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"每行个数\",\"attribute_key\":\"col_per_row\",\"value\":\"2\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"展示样式\",\"attribute_key\":\"displa